OL,5,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe B&Bers go glamping at Little
OL,7,     FOakhurst in Stonyhurst, near
OL,8,     FClitheroe, run by Andy and Joanne.
OL,9,     FThe views are spectacular, but it
OL,10,     Fsoon becomes apparent that
OL,11,     Fglamping isn't for everyone...
OL,12,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThere's plenty of score settling
OL,14,     Fto be done on payment day as the
OL,15,     FB&Bers dissect the week, before
OL,16,     Fthe payments are revealed and the
OL,17,     Fwinners are announced.
